🔴 IRGC Navy announced that four US-backed vessels violated maritime regulations and attempted to transit the Strait of Hormuz through an unsafe route after disabling their navigation systems and ignoring warnings.

🔺 Two of the vessels suffered incidents and were forced to halt, while the other two abandoned their attempt and turned back.

